{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is near, then grab it and process, or move closer and repeat. Finally, check properties and perform task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNearby    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PerformSpecificTask    />",
